  "notes": [
    "vs.BuildResourceList(96, -174, \"\") lists the 43 line types of Libraries/Attributes/Line Types in the application folder. The probe of 2026-10-19 read item 37 as Sine Wave and item 15 as Hot Water. The list is sorted by name, so a library with other line types moves these items.",
    "The probe listed Sine Wave and Hot Water among the complex line types of the library. DXF writes a complex line type as an LTYPE with shape or text elements. resource.linetype.dashed covers a simple dash.",
    "In the DXF of 2026-10-19 (dxf.all-content), Hot Water is an LTYPE of 5 elements with one text element, and the polyline uses it. Sine Wave has no LTYPE. The line is an INSERT of an anonymous block."
  ]
